WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.632
Open Source Intelligence becomes useful when public information is collected and assessed through a disciplined workflow.

00:00:06.632 --> 00:00:11.940
Random searching may produce interesting links, but it rarely creates a defensible answer.

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:16.023
A workflow connects the original question to sources, evidence, reasoning,

00:00:16.023 --> 00:00:17.656
and a decision-relevant result.

00:00:17.656 --> 00:00:19.289
Structure reduces wasted effort.

00:00:19.289 --> 00:00:23.780
Clear stages help analysts decide where to look, when to stop,

00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:26.230
and which material deserves deeper review.

00:00:26.230 --> 00:00:30.312
Without boundaries, collection can expand indefinitely while important sources, dates,

00:00:30.312 --> 00:00:33.987
and assumptions disappear into browser tabs and personal notes.

00:00:33.987 --> 00:00:36.028
A workflow also preserves evidence.

00:00:36.028 --> 00:00:40.928
URLs can change, pages can be updated, and search results can move.

00:00:40.928 --> 00:00:43.786
Recording source context, access time, relevant excerpts,

00:00:43.786 --> 00:00:48.685
and approved preservation artifacts allows another reviewer to understand what was available

00:00:48.685 --> 00:00:50.726
when a judgment was made.

00:00:50.726 --> 00:00:51.951
Repeatability improves quality.

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:55.626
Another analyst may not reproduce an identical search ranking,

00:00:55.626 --> 00:01:00.933
but they should be able to follow the requirement, collection logic, source trail,

00:01:00.933 --> 00:01:02.158
and analytical reasoning.

00:01:02.158 --> 00:01:04.608
Review exposes unsupported leaps, duplicated claims,

00:01:04.608 --> 00:01:07.874
and missing alternatives before they shape a decision.

00:01:07.874 --> 00:01:09.915
Ethics belongs in every stage.

00:01:09.915 --> 00:01:11.548
Purpose, authority, privacy, proportionality,

00:01:11.548 --> 00:01:15.631
and access boundaries determine what should be collected and retained.

00:01:15.631 --> 00:01:19.306
Public visibility never authorizes harassment, doxxing, impersonation, access-control bypass,

00:01:19.306 --> 00:01:20.530
or unlawful surveillance.

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:23.797
A mature workflow ends with reporting and feedback.

00:01:23.797 --> 00:01:27.879
The result should answer the requirement, explain confidence and limitations,

00:01:27.879 --> 00:01:29.921
and identify proportionate next steps.

00:01:29.921 --> 00:01:34.820
Feedback from the consumer then sharpens future questions, sources, methods, and reporting.
